      <div class="q-section-hdr">
        <h3>Questions 6–13</h3>
        <p>Do the following statements agree with the information given in Reading Passage 1?<br>
        <b>TRUE</b> if the statement agrees, <b>FALSE</b> if it contradicts, <b>NOT GIVEN</b> if there is no information on this.</p>
