      <div id="tfn-blocks">
    <div class="tfn-block q-card q-card q-card ielts-listening-question-item" id="qblock-6"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">6</strong>
      <div class="tfn-stmt"><b>6.</b> The Bedouin teenagers who found the scrolls were disappointed by how little money they received for them.</div>
