    </div>
    <div class="tfn-block q-card q-card q-card ielts-listening-question-item" id="qblock-8"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">8</strong>
      <div class="tfn-stmt"><b>8.</b> Most of the books of the Bible written on the scrolls are incomplete.</div>
      <div class="tfn-opts"><label><input type="radio" value="TRUE" name="practice_single_reading_32_8" id="practice_single_reading_32_8_TRUE" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 8: TRUE">TRUE</label><label><input type="radio" value="FALSE" name="practice_single_reading_32_8" id="practice_single_reading_32_8_FALSE" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 8: FALSE">FALSE</label><label><input type="radio" value="NOT GIVEN" name="practice_single_reading_32_8" id="practice_single_reading_32_8_NOT GIVEN" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 8: NOT GIVEN">NOT GIVEN</label></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tfn-block q-card q-card q-card ielts-listening-question-item" id="qblock-9"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">9</strong>
      <div class="tfn-stmt"><b>9.</b> The information on the Copper Scroll is written in an unusual way.</div>
      <div class="tfn-opts"><label><input type="radio" value="TRUE" name="practice_single_reading_32_9" id="practice_single_reading_32_9_TRUE" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 9: TRUE">TRUE</label><label><input type="radio" value="FALSE" name="practice_single_reading_32_9" id="practice_single_reading_32_9_FALSE" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 9: FALSE">FALSE</label><label><input type="radio" value="NOT GIVEN" name="practice_single_reading_32_9" id="practice_single_reading_32_9_NOT GIVEN" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 9: NOT GIVEN">NOT GIVEN</label></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tfn-block q-card q-card q-card ielts-listening-question-item" id="qblock-10"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">10</strong>
      <div class="tfn-stmt"><b>10.</b> Mar Samuel was given some of the scrolls as a gift.</div>
      <div class="tfn-opts"><label><input type="radio" value="TRUE" name="practice_single_reading_32_10" id="practice_single_reading_32_10_TRUE" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 10: TRUE">TRUE</label><label><input type="radio" value="FALSE" name="practice_single_reading_32_10" id="practice_single_reading_32_10_FALSE" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 10: FALSE">FALSE</label><label><input type="radio" value="NOT GIVEN" name="practice_single_reading_32_10" id="practice_single_reading_32_10_NOT GIVEN" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 10: NOT GIVEN">NOT GIVEN</label></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tfn-block q-card q-card q-card ielts-listening-question-item" id="qblock-11"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">11</strong>
      <div class="tfn-stmt"><b>11.</b> In the early 1950s, a number of educational establishments in the US were keen to buy scrolls from Mar Samuel.</div>
      <div class="tfn-opts"><label><input type="radio" value="TRUE" name="practice_single_reading_32_11" id="practice_single_reading_32_11_TRUE" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 11: TRUE">TRUE</label><label><input type="radio" value="FALSE" name="practice_single_reading_32_11" id="practice_single_reading_32_11_FALSE" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 11: FALSE">FALSE</label><label><input type="radio" value="NOT GIVEN" name="practice_single_reading_32_11" id="practice_single_reading_32_11_NOT GIVEN" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 11: NOT GIVEN">NOT GIVEN</label></div>
