      <div class="tfn-stmt"><b>12.</b> The scroll that was pieced together in 2017 contains information about annual occasions in the Qumran area 2,000 years ago.</div>
      <div class="tfn-opts"><label><input type="radio" value="TRUE" name="practice_single_reading_32_12" id="practice_single_reading_32_12_TRUE" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 12: TRUE">TRUE</label><label><input type="radio" value="FALSE" name="practice_single_reading_32_12" id="practice_single_reading_32_12_FALSE" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 12: FALSE">FALSE</label><label><input type="radio" value="NOT GIVEN" name="practice_single_reading_32_12" id="practice_single_reading_32_12_NOT GIVEN" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 12: NOT GIVEN">NOT GIVEN</label></div>
